# Used ONLY by scripts/pull_data.py, which runs offline on a laptop.
#
# The deployed app needs no secret. It reads a committed Parquet and makes no
# network call, which is the whole point of spec §1.1 — nothing can fail on
# stage. Do not add this to Streamlit Community Cloud secrets.
#
# Without a token you share an anonymous rate-limit pool with every other
# unauthenticated caller and will see intermittent 429s on a long pull.
# Get one at https://data.cityofnewyork.us/profile/edit/developer_settings
SOCRATA_APP_TOKEN=
